The worklist is a `symbol`/`wrap` batch. The main boundary requirements are LZO’s hidden buffer padding, CRC tables that callers must not be able to corrupt, and UUID/base64 buffer sizes. I’ll encode those requirements in safe APIs; the nine size globals will be immutable `'static` borrows.
